  <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
    <details key="documentation" value="The Analysis Services engine namespace: the object definitions a Create or Alter carries and DISCOVER_XML_METADATA answers with - Server, Database, Cube and the rest. [MS-SSAS] 2.2.4.2: all types in that section are in this namespace unless stated otherwise; the published xmla.xsd re-declares them in the xml-analysis namespace, and the document is the truth. Split out of the former assl package by spec/split_assl_engine_types.py."/>
