      <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
        <details key="documentation" value="This string is to contain a DAX Boolean expression that evaluates to TRUE for the rows in the table that are allowed. This is equivalent to saying that the table expression that returns the allowed rows is FILTER (ALL (Table), AllowedRowsExpression).&lt;121>If the DAX Boolean expression is empty, it is treated as TRUE.If the DAX Boolean expression evaluates to an error, it is treated as FALSE for those rows and permission is not allowed."/>
