        <details key="documentation" value="Specifies the foreground color of a cell in the RGB format.&lt;96>The valid range for an ordinary RGB color is from zero (&amp;H00000000) to 16,777,215 (&amp;H00FFFFFF). The high byte of a number in this range always equals zero. The lower 3 bytes, from least to most significant byte, determine the amount of red, green, and blue, respectively. The red, green, and blue components are each represented by a number between 0 and 255 (&amp;HFF)."/>
      </eAnnotations>
