      <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
        <details key="documentation" value="The type of object to which this Action applies. Such objects are limited to those in the enumeration that is specified in the XSD. The following objects are allowed:&quot;Cube&quot;: A Cube object.&quot;Cells&quot;: A subcube. Subcubes are created by using MDX [MSDN-CREATESUBCUBE].&quot;Set&quot;: A set. Sets are created by using MDX [MSDN-CREATESET].&quot;Hierarchy&quot;: A Hierarchy object. &quot;Level&quot;: A Level object. &quot;DimensionMembers&quot;: The members of a Dimension. &quot;HierarchyMembers&quot;: The members of a Hierarchy. &quot;LevelMembers&quot;: The members of a Level. &quot;AttributeMembers&quot;: The members of a DimensionAttribute."/>
